GAL22V10
PAL20L10

I1 I2 I3 I4 I5 I6 I7 I8 I9 I10 I11 GND
I13 O14 I15 I16 O17 O18 O19 O20 O21 O22 O23 VCC


; IC pin 23 -- 2/8 product terms
/O23 = /I8 * /I7 * /I1
       + I8 * I7 * /I2

; IC pin 22 -- 1/10 product terms
/O22 = /I11 * /I3

; IC pin 21 -- 1/12 product terms
/O21 = I11 * /I3

; IC pin 20 -- 1/14 product terms
/O20 = /I16 * /I6

; IC pin 19 -- 1/16 product terms
/O19 = /I16 * /I5

; IC pin 18 -- 1/16 product terms
/O18 = /I11 * I10 * /I9 * /I4

; IC pin 17 -- 1/14 product terms
/O17 = I15

; IC pin 14 -- 1/8 product terms
/O14 = /I16 * /I13


DESCRIPTION
Reconstructed from a dpdumper sweep of a PAL20L10.
Target device is a GAL22V10/ATF22V10C (pin-compatible).
Equations are active-low (espresso minimised the OFF-set).
